EGRESS-BY-DESIGN — NOT SHIPPED PRODUCT:
This tool is an egress-by-design DEV utility, deliberately housed under tools/
and OUTSIDE the shipped ne-connect product package. It pushes data INTO the
M365/Salesforce/Slack dev tenants so the read-only connectors can pull it back
(the NE-077 LIVE gate). The ne-connect C2 egress guardian
(packages/ne-connect/tests/test_c2_egress_guardian.py) deliberately does NOT
cover this tool — it pins the outbound-HTTP surface of the SHIPPED product only.
The seeder's egress rides exclusively through subclasses of the connector
clients (inheriting their SSRF / host-allowlist / air-gap / guard-before-token
guarantees); it adds no write verbs to packages/ne-connect. This tool MUST NEVER
be shipped to a customer runtime. It seeds ONLY the committed, RFC-2606-safe
tools/acme synthetic corpus (all @acme.example / +1-555-01XX).
